FR:
{{TAG:000C:0001:}}{{TAG:000C:0004:}}{{TAG:000C:0002:}}{{TAG:000C:0006:}}{{TAG:0003:001B:}}Bah alors ?!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} Fallait surtout pas vous
presser, hein...{{TAG:0000:0004:}}Encore un peu, et je venais vous
chercher en personne,{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
{{TAG:0005:0007:}} !{{TAG:000C:0009:}}

EN:
{{TAG:000C:0000:}}{{TAG:000C:0007:}}{{TAG:000C:0002:}}{{TAG:000C:0005:}}{{TAG:000C:0001:}}{{TAG:000C:0008:}}{{TAG:000E:0003:}}{{TAG:0011:0001:0000}}!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} This must be a big deal
if you went to all this trouble just
to get me over here, right?{{TAG:000C:0009:}}

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:000C:0000:}}{{TAG:000C:0007:}}{{TAG:000C:0002:}}{{TAG:000C:0005:}}{{TAG:000C:0001:}}{{TAG:000C:0008:}}{{TAG:000E:0003:}}{{TAG:0011:0001:0000}}!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} Beni buraya getirmek
