olmalı, değil mi?{{TAG:000C:0009:}}

EN:
{{TAG:000C:0000:}}{{TAG:000C:0005:}}I found something when I was out
jogging earlier.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} It's yours, isn't it?{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Didn't mean to worry you!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} Here you
go!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} It's all yours!{{TAG:000C:0009:}}

ES:
{{TAG:000C:0000:}}{{TAG:000C:0005:}}Antes, al salir por ahí a correr, me
encontré algo.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} Esto es tuyo, ¿no?{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0001:}}¡No pretendía preocuparte!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
¡Aquí tienes! {{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}¡Todo tuyo!{{TAG:000C:0009:}}

IT:
{{TAG:000C:0000:}}{{TAG:000C:0005:}}Ho trovato una cosa per terra
mentre correvo prima.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} È tua,
vero?{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Non volevo farti preoccupare!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Ecco qua!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} Prendi!{{TAG:000C:0009:}}

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:000C:0000:}}{{TAG:000C:0005:}}Az önce koşarken bir şey buldum.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} Senin,
değil mi?{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Seni endişelendirmek istemedim!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Al bakalım!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} Tamamen senin!{{TAG:000C:0009:}}

IT:
{{TAG:000C:0000:}}{{TAG:000C:0005:}}{{TAG:0003:000C:}}Ho la sensazione che ai miei amici
non piaccia lo stile della mia casa.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Anzi, ne sono quasi certo{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:000D:}}Dammi una mano!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} Cosa c'è
che non va nella mia casa?{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
Che posso fare?!{{TAG:0000:0004:}}Ti conosco e so che mi darai
un parere onesto, senza
troppi giri di parole.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}{{TAG:000C:0009:}}

DE:
{{TAG:000C:0000:}}{{TAG:000C:0007:}}{{TAG:0003:0007:}}Machste Witze?!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} Ich sag dir mal
was:{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} Es liegt nicht an deiner Bude,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
sondern an dir,{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} Sportsfreund!
{{TAG:0003:0006:}}Du machst dir 'nen Kopf um nichts!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} 
Du machst dir Sorgen,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} was die
Leute von deiner Bude denken?{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Haste überhaupt kein Rückgrat?{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Als Sportler muss man doch Selbst-
bewusstsein haben, {{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}oder etwa nich'?
{{TAG:0003:0028:}}{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}Hör auf,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} dir über das Geschwätz der
Leute Gedanken zu machen{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} Deine
Bude ist nämlich gar nicht so übel!{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}{{TAG:0003:0024:}}

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:000C:0000:}}{{TAG:000C:0007:}}{{TAG:0003:0007:}}Şaka mı yapıyorsun?!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} Sorun evinde değil,{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
sende!{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0006:}}Hiç yoktan dert ediyorsun!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Başkalarının evin hakkında
ne düşündüğünü kafanda kuruyorsun?!
İçgüdülerine güven biraz!{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0002:}}{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}Hem insanların
ne düşünüp düşünmediğini kafana takmayı
bırak{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}çünkü bu oda
kesinlikle kötü değil!{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}{{TAG:0003:0001:}}

ES:
Bueno, pues yo me las piro.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
Ya hablaremos otro día.{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0000:}}{{TAG:000C:0002:}}{{TAG:000C:0003:}}{{TAG:000E:0003:}}{{TAG:0005:0008:}}, gracias por venir
